rn rendering. High detail, inviting, magical, premium.\n\nUI: At the very top, show the game title “WAR TABLE” and four compact player pills matching crimson, cobalt, amber, and emerald. Use pixel-bordered navy dialog panels and a small but readable pixel font. At the bottom, a thumb-friendly dock with four clearly legible tabs reading exactly: “Place” “Attack” “Fortify” “End”. Include a large prominent button reading exactly “Blitz”. Preserve comfortable mobile spacing and make the UI look functional and polished.\n\nPriority hierarchy: (1) readable world map and four ownership colors, (2) readable miniature unit silhouettes and army numbers, (3) exact readable interface labels, (4) aurora-lit cozy night diorama atmosphere. No hands, no phone hardware frame, no unrelated text, no logos, no watermark.","bytes":2655561,"durationMs":59085,"attempts":1,"model":"gpt-5.6-sol","modelProvider":"openai","reasoningEffort":"low","threadId":"01a0e8c3-e298-72f0-bf06-3d7f7bee4d43"}]}
